\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Derived V\&V linkage categories. Values are overlapping report memberships among 40 included reports. This mixed-source union uses V\&V artifacts, direct pre-physical mechanisms, and integration/test readiness; the generic/planned fallback additionally uses controlled RQ3 relevance when no coded artifact or mechanism is selected. Not every category is direct pre-physical evidence, and readiness does not establish closure.}}{12}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
